00:06:50.276 --> 00:06:53.011
-And he gave us notes, and we
wrote them down with pencils.

00:06:53.011 --> 00:06:55.214
-"Oh, we're going to fix it."
-"Okay. Good idea, Seth."

00:06:55.214 --> 00:06:57.116
