-But this is a special occasion.

00:07:25.444 --> 00:07:27.680
[ Laughter ]

00:07:27.680 --> 00:07:31.717
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:31.717 --> 00:07:35.387
So this time we're going to
do things differently.

00:07:35.387 --> 00:07:37.256
We are going to read the setups

00:07:37.256 --> 00:07:39.358
