00:11:31.624 --> 00:11:34.259
an article titled
"African American Studies

00:11:34.259 --> 00:11:35.594
Is Meant for Everyone."

00:11:35.594 --> 00:11:38.063
-Unlike Princeton,
which is meant for white people.

00:11:38.063 --> 00:11:40.999
[ Laughter ]
-Wow. Wow.

00:11:40.999 --> 00:11:43.435
-The speed with which
he said it.

00:11:43.435 --> 00:11:44.603
-Yeah.
-"White people."

00:11:44.603 --> 00:11:45.904
-[ Indistinct ]
-You know what?

00:11:45.904 --> 00:11:47.239
I'm starting to
get in the groove.

00:11:47.239 --> 00:11:49.774
[ Laughter ]
I mean, you know what?

00:11:49.774 --> 00:11:51.743
Now I'm just going to do them
all with pure enthusiasm,

00:11:51.743 --> 00:11:53.512
like I believe it.
-Okay. Alright.

00:11:53.512 --> 00:11:54.747
-Uh-oh.

00:11:54.747 --> 00:11:58.918
[ Laughter ]

00:12:01.153 --> 00:12:02.321
-I have literally --

00:12:02.321 --> 00:12:04.457
We've almost done
1,500 episodes of this show.

00:12:04.457 --> 00:12:06.325
That's the most audible "uh-oh."

00:12:06.325 --> 00:12:09.562
[ Laughter ]

00:12:09.562 --> 00:12:10.696
-Yeah.

00:12:10.696 --> 00:12:13.098
-And I think
there were two of them.

00:12:13.098 --> 00:12:15.033
-It was like
the audience member was miked.

00:12:15.033 --> 00:12:17.036
-Yeah.
-[ Clears throat ]

00:12:17.036 --> 00:12:18.137
-[ Clears throat ]
-[ Clears throat ]

00:12:18.203 --> 00:12:19.472
-[ Clears throat ]
-[ Clears throat ]

