-[ Laughs ]

00:12:39.291 --> 00:12:41.994
-Hey, guys! Why don't --
Oh, yeah. You guys.

00:12:41.994 --> 00:12:43.762
Hey, why don't you tell one?

00:12:43.762 --> 00:12:45.030
-Oh, no. We couldn't.

00:12:45.030 --> 00:12:46.565
